OL,4,CStrabane withdraws from UK Town of     
OL,5,CCulture bid due to 'great division'    
OL,6,GA competition that is supposed to      
OL,7,Gcelebrate local towns has been         
OL,8,Grejected by a council after it caused  
OL,9,G"great division" over its UK title.    
OL,11,FThe mainly-nationalist town of         
OL,12,FStrabane in County Tyrone was          
OL,13,Fshortlisted as one of 15 possible      
OL,14,Flocations for the inaugural UK Town of 
OL,15,FCulture 2028, with the chance to win   
OL,16,F#3m.                                   
